  "CORROBORATION_by_the_repos_own_instrument": {
    "what": "ladder_replay.sweep() ALREADY EXISTED and does this job. It was found only after this script was written \u2014 a duplication that should not have happened. It is the better instrument: it runs on the FROZEN archived replay bytes behind a completeness gate, not on a locally re-ingested database.",
